BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:America on Screen: Small Town Life
DTSTART:20261211T140000Z
DTEND:20261211T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20261126T222212Z
UID:3ce94e95b57af273@nerdhang
CATEGORIES:museum
DESCRIPTION:Join us on select Friday afternoons for a special film series 
 commemorating America’s 250th: Anniversary: America on Screen. Enjoy scr
 eenings of Smithsonian Channel programs that explore the people\, places\,
  and stories that shaped America. Small Town Life Small towns are the hear
 t and soul of America. At the turn of the century\, tightly knit communiti
 es embodied the pioneer spirit. Small-town heroes like Will Rogers and Jim
 my Stewart capture the nation’s hearts. In reality\, many are mired in p
 ov\n\nSource: The Long Island Museum\n\nhttps://longislandmuseum.org/event
 /america-on-screen-small-town-life/
GEO:40.9302945;-73.1151874
LOCATION:The Long Island Museum\, 1200 Route 25A\, Stony Brook\, NY 11790
URL:https://longislandmuseum.org/event/america-on-screen-small-town-life/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist Spotlight: David Bunn Martine
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T143000
DTSTAMP:20261126T222212Z
UID:afc7af589c68ba8e@nerdhang
CATEGORIES:museum
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special artist talk with David Bunn Martine\, a 
 featured artist in Enduring Heart: Native American Long Island. A member o
 f the Shinnecock/Montauk Nations and a descendant of the Nde Daa’i (Nedn
 ai) Chiricahua Apache\, Martine will share insights into his artwork\, cre
 ative process\, and the stories and histories that inform his work. He wil
 l also present archival photographs from Long Island’s Native American c
 ommunities\, offering a deeper look at the people\, traditions\, and histo
 ries \n\nSource: The Long Island Museum\n\nhttps://longislandmuseum.org/ev
 ent/david-bunn-martine/
GEO:40.9302945;-73.1151874
LOCATION:The Long Island Museum\, 1200 Route 25A\, Stony Brook\, NY 11790
URL:https://longislandmuseum.org/event/david-bunn-martine/
END:VEVENT
